			"notes": "- Fixed step-up **sticking / oscillating** when you land on or run into a block edge going down. It now steps you up cleanly instead of pinning you at the edge for a few ticks.\n- Descending step-ups now **apply fall damage** (respecting the launch-height clamp) and land you properly.\n- Holding **dash into a low, steppable ledge** now steps you up onto it instead of walljumping off it. Tall walls still walljump."
		},
