			"notes": "**Hotfix for v1.9.0, which crashed on startup for everyone** (a mixin `@Shadow`ed `isOnGround()`/`getY()` — inherited from Entity — which don't resolve on LivingEntity in the remapped jar). Fixed by accessing those public members via a cast instead of `@Shadow`.\n\n**Use this instead of v1.9.0.** All v1.9.0 features are included: ice physics, crouch/dash step-up launches, launch-height fall damage, ladder fix, sprint-speed strip, server \"moved too quickly\" bypass, steady FOV, resolution-independent HUD."
		},
